#: kmidi.cpp:784
msgid ""
"These leds show<br>\n"
"the number of notes<br>\n"
"being played."
msgstr ""
"Ovi signali pokazuju<br>\n"
"broj nota koje se sviraju."

#: kmidi.cpp:797
msgid ""
"The <i>status</i> led is<br>\n"
"<b>red</b> when KMidi is<br>\n"
"stopped, <b>yellow</b> when<br>\n"
"paused, otherwise:<br>\n"
"<b>blue</b> when looping on<br>\n"
"the same song<br>\n"
"<b>magenta</b> when selecting<br>\n"
"songs randomly<br>\n"
"or <b>green</b> when KMidi is<br>\n"
"playing or ready to play."
msgstr ""
"<i>Statusni</i> signal je<br>\n"
"<b>crven</b> kada je KMidi<br>\n"
"zaustavljen, <b>žut</b> kada<br>\n"
"je pauziran, a inače je:<br>\n"
"<b>plav</b> prilikom kruženja<br>\n"
"na istoj pjesmi<br>\n"
"<b>ljubičast</b> prilikom nasumičnog<br>\n"
"izbora pjesama<br>\n"
"ili <b>zelen</b> kada KMidi svira<br>\n"
"ili je spreman za sviranje."

#: kmidi.cpp:808
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <i>loading</i> LED<br>\n"
"blinks <b>yellow</b> when<br>\n"
"patches are being<br>\n"
"loaded from the hard drive."
msgstr ""
"Signal <i>učitavanja</i><br>\n"
"svjetluca <b>žuto</b> kada<br>\n"
"se patchevi učitavaju sa<br>\n"
"hard diska."

#: kmidi.cpp:813
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <i>lyrics</i> LED<br>\n"
"lights up when a<br>\n"
"synchronized MIDI text<br>\n"
"event is being displayed<br>\n"
"in the <i>info</i> window."
msgstr ""
"Signal <i>stihovi</i> je<br>\n"
"upaljen kada se sinhronizirani<br>\n"
"midi tekst događaj prikazuje u<br>\n"
"<i>info</i> prozoru."

#: kmidi.cpp:819
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <i>buffer</i> LED<br>\n"
"is orangeish when there is<br>\n"
"danger of a dropout, but<br>\n"
"greenish when all is ok."
msgstr ""
"Signal <i>buffer</i> je<br>\n"
"narandžast kada postoji<br>\n"
"opasnost od ispuštanja, a<br>\n"
"zelenkast kada je sve ok."

#: kmidi.cpp:824
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <i>interpolation</i> LED<br>\n"
"is on when c-spline or<br>\n"
"LaGrange interpolation<br>\n"
"is being used for resampling."
msgstr ""
"Signal <i>interpolacija</i><br>\n"
"je uklju;en kada se koristi<br>\n"
"c-spline ili LaGrange interpolacija<br>\n"
"za resampliranje."

#: kmidi.cpp:828
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <i>echo</i> LED<br>\n"
"is on when KMidi is<br>\n"
"not too busy to generate<br>\n"
"extra echo notes<br>\n"
"for reverberation effect.<br>\n"
"It's bright when you've<br>\n"
"asked for extra reverberation."
msgstr ""
"Signal <i>echo</i> je<br>\n"
"uključen kada KMidi nije<br>\n"
"prezauzet da generiše<br>\n"
"dodatne echo note za<br>\n"
"efekat reverberacije.<br>\n"
"Svijetao je kada ste tražili<br>\n"
"dodatnu reverberaciju."

#: kmidi.cpp:835
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The <i>detune</i> LED<br>\n"
"is on when KMidi is<br>\n"
"not too busy to generate<br>\n"
"extra detuned notes<br>\n"
"for chorusing effect.<br>\n"
"It's bright when you've<br>\n"
"asked for extra chorusing."
msgstr ""
"Signal <i>detune</i> je<br>\n"
"uključen kada KMidi nije<br>\n"
"prezauzet da generiše dodatne<br>\n"
"detunirane tonove za<br>\n"
"efekat chorus-a.<br>\n"
"On je svijetao kada ste<br>\n"
"tražili dodatno chorus-iranje."

#: kmidi.cpp:845
msgid "ichecks"
msgstr "ichecks"

#: kmidi.cpp:852
msgid "Resample using linear interpolation."
msgstr "Resampluj koristeći linearnu interpolaciju."

#: kmidi.cpp:853
msgid "Resample using c-spline interpolation."
msgstr "Resampluj koristeći c-spline interpolaciju."

#: kmidi.cpp:854
msgid "Resample using LaGrange interpolation."
msgstr "Resampluj koristeći LaGrange interpolaciju."

#: kmidi.cpp:855
msgid ""
"Resample using c-spline<br>\n"
"interpolation with<br>\n"
"the low pass filter."
msgstr ""
"Resampluj koristeći c-spline<br>\n"
"interpolaciju sa<br>\n"
"niskoprolaznim filterom."

#: kmidi.cpp:865
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The display shows notes<br>\n"
" being played on the<br>\n"
"16 or 32 MIDI channels."
msgstr ""
"Ekran prikazuje note<br>\n"
" koje se sviraju na<br>\n"
"16 ili 32 midi kanala."

#: kmidi.cpp:887
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Here is information<br>\n"
"extracted from the MIDI<br>\n"
"file currently being played."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje se nalaze informacije<br>\n"
"ekstraktovane iz midi<br>\n"
"datoteke koja se trenutno svira."

#: kmidi.cpp:901
msgid ""
"Choose a patchset.<br>\n"
"(You can add patchsets by<br>\n"
"downloading them from somewhere<br>\n"
"and editing the file<br>\n"
"$KDEDIR/share/apps/kmidi/<br>\n"
"config/timidity.cfg .)"
msgstr ""
"Izaberite patchset.<br>\n"
"(Možete dodati patchsetove<br>\n"
"downloadujući ih odnekud<br>\n"
"i editujući datoteku<br>\n"
"$KDEDIR/share/apps/kmidi/<br>\n"
"config/timidity.cfg .)"

#: kmidi.cpp:922
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Select a MIDI file<br>\n"
"to play from this<br>\n"
"play list."
msgstr ""
"Izaberite midi datoteku<br>\n"
"za svirati sa ove<br>\n"
"liste pjesama."

#: kmidi.cpp:931
msgid ""
"These are the playlist files<br>\n"
"you've created using<br>\n"
" the <i>playlist editor</i>.<br>\n"
"Click on one, and its<br>\n"
"contents will replace<br>\n"
"the play list above."
msgstr ""
"Ovo su datoteke sa listom<br>\n"
"pjesama koje ste napravili<br>  koristeći <i>editor liste pjesama</i>.<br>\n"
"Kliknite na jednu, a njen sadržaj<br>\n"
"će zamijeniti listu pjesama<br>\n"
"gore."

#: kmidi.cpp:971
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are three settings:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> for no extra stereo notes<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> for normal stereo<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> for notes panned<br>\n"
"left and right artificially"
msgstr ""
"Postoje tri opcije:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> za bez dodatnih stereo tonova<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> za normalan stereo<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> za vještačko panovanje<br>\n"
"nota lijevo i desno."

#: kmidi.cpp:976
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are three settings:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> for no extra echo notes<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> for echoing<br>\n"
"when a patch specifies<br>\n"
"reverberation<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> for added reverb<br>\n"
"for all instruments"
msgstr ""
"Postoje tri opcije:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> za bez dodatnih echo tonova<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> za echo kada patch<br>\n"
"određuje reverberaciju, ili<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> za dodatni reverb<br>\n"
"na svim instrumentima."

#: kmidi.cpp:982
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are three settings:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> for no extra detuned notes<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> for detuned notes<br>\n"
"when a patch specifies<br>\n"
"chorusing<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> for added chorusing<br>\n"
"for all instruments"
msgstr ""
"Postoje tri opcije:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> za bez dodatnih detuned tonova<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> za detuned note kada<br>\n"
"patch određuje chorusing, ili<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> za dodatni chorusing<br>\n"
"na svim instrumentima."

#: kmidi.cpp:988
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"There are three settings:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> for only name and lyrics<br>\n"
"shown in the <i>info</i> window<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> for all text<br>\n"
"messages to be shown<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> to also display<br>\n"
"information about patches<br>\n"
"as they are loaded from disk"
msgstr ""
"Postoje tri opcije:<br>\n"
"<b>off</b> za prikaz samo imena i stihova<br>\n"
"u <i>info</i> prozoru;<br>\n"
"<b>no change</b> za prikaz svih tekst<br>\n"
"poruka, ili<br>\n"
"<b>checked/on</b> za prikaz također i<br>\n"
"informacija o patchevima koji<br>\n"
"su učitani sa diska."

#: kmidi.cpp:1001
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When this button is down,<br>\n"
"filters are used for the<br>\n"
"<i>MIDI</i> channel effects:<br>\n"
"<b>chorus</b>, <b>reverberation</b>,<br>\n"
"<b>celeste</b> and <b>phaser</b>.<br>\n"
"When it is off, <b>chorus</b> is<br>\n"
"applied instead with extra detuned<br>\n"
"notes, and <b>reverberation</b> is<br>\n"
"applied with echo notes, but<br>\n"
"the other effects are not applied."
msgstr ""
"Kada je dugme pritisnuto,<br>\n"
"koriste se filter za efekte<br>\n"
"<i>midi</i><br> kanala<br>\n"
"<b>chorus</b>, <b>reverberation</b>,<br>\n"
"<b>celeste</b> i <b>phaser</b>.<br>\n"
"Kada je isključeno, umjesto toga se<br>\n"
"radi <b>chorus</b> sa dodatnim detuned<br>\n"
"notama, a <b>reverberacija</b> se<br>\n"
"radi pomoću echo nota, a ostali<br>\n"
"efekti se ne rade."

#: kmidi.cpp:1019
msgid ""
"Use this to set the maximum<br>\n"
"notes that can be played<br>\n"
"at one time. Use a lower<br>\n"
"setting to avoid dropouts."
msgstr ""
"Koristite ovo da podesite<br>\n"
"maksimalan broj nota koje<br>\n"
"se mogu svirati istovremeno.<br>\n"
"Koristite nižu vrijednost da<br>\n"
"izbjegnete ispuštanje."

#: kmidi.cpp:1035
msgid ""
"This setting is a delay,<br>\n"
"in hundredths of a second, before a played<br>\n"
"note is displayed on the<br>\n"
"channel meter to the left.<br>\n"
"It may help to synchronize the<br>\n"
"display with the music."
msgstr ""

